{
    "title": "Tempt: Romance Audiobooks",
    "description": "Looking for Unlimited Listening to premium quality dark, contemporary audiobooks at a reasonable price? Love romance audiobooks from bestselling authors and fantastic narrators? You've found the perfect place to indulge in great novels!\r\n\r\nDiscover an impressive selection of audiobooks and romance stories on Tempt. Whether you're an avid reader or new to the world of novel romance, our handpicked collection of romance audiobooks will captivate you.\r\n\r\nExpand your horizons with our audio library a curated selection of romance audiobooks for a well-rounded listening experience.\r\n\r\nCreate your virtual library and fill your digital bookshelf with love and romance. Hot rich billionaires, mafia, werewolves, dark drama, and other novels are there for you - pick your story any time of the day!\r\n\r\nOur books on audio make it easy to enjoy novels in English wherever you are, be it during your commute or while relaxing at home.\r\n\r\nAt Tempt, we strive to provide only the best romance audiobooks for your enjoyment. With new titles added weekly, there's always a fresh audio story to explore.\r\n\r\nDive into the world of love romance stories. Watch how the main character falls in love with her billionaire boss, ends up being married to the mafia leader, or gets connected to a group of vampires. We guarantee that hot rich billionaire novels will become your thing if it isn\u2019t yet.\r\n\r\nIn addition to romance, our books library app also features a variety of love stories that will touch your heart and stir your emotions.\r\n\r\nFed up with dealing with credits and coins, endless chapters, and poor-quality narration and writing? Tempt offers a refreshing alternative:\r\n - Wide variety of captivating stories to choose from.\r\n - Our authors are bestselling, ensuring top-notch storytelling.\r\n - Our voices are delivered by award-winning narrators for an immersive experience.\r\n - All our stories are complete, so you won't be left hanging.\r\n\r\nOur listeners love Tempt for its convenience and user-friendliness. Say goodbye to hours of searching in an endless catalog; we've done the work for you. Utilize our \"Search by Trope\" or \"Spice Level\" features to find exactly what you desire! It\u2019s as easy as reaching to your bookshelf.\r\nExplore Tempt's diverse catalog featuring exciting paranormal, dark, and contemporary audiobooks, including billionaires, alphas, rockstars, and inked bad boys.\r\n\r\nCalling all book lovers! Tempt caters to various tastes with gentle love novels and drama romance stories.\r\n\r\nIf forbidden love entices you, delve into our dark romances with love triangles, captivity, mafia, and age gaps. Additionally, we offer reverse harem, omegaverse, and paranormal reads featuring vampires, shifters, and werewolf romance fantasy.\r\n\r\nYour next favorite novel awaits! Experience the joy of indulging in romance novels.\r\nFor fans of contemporary romance, don't miss our friends-to-lovers, enemies-to-lovers, second chance, romantic suspense love stories, and mafia romance books.\r\n\r\nReady to be continuously tempted by breathtaking love tales or intrigued by mafia romance? Join the Tempt community today and immerse yourself in incredible romantic stories brought to life by mesmerizing voices.\r\n\r\nCurious to know more? Download our audiobook player with novel stories now!\r\nStay updated and follow us on:\r\nInstagram: https://www.instagram.com/tempt.app\r\nFacebook: https://www.facebook.com/temptromance\r\nWebsite: https://wromance.com/\r\n\r\nBy using Tempt: Romance Audio Books, you agree to our Terms of Use and Community Guidelines available at: https://wromance.com/terms_and_conditions.html and to our Privacy Policy available at: https://wromance.com/privacy_policy.html.",
